<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-VICTORIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-VICTORIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores from the first</p>
<p>round of the Victorian Open golf tournament at the par-72</p>
<p>Victorian Golf Club on Thursday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>64 Stephen Leaney</p>
<p>66 Paul Devenport (New Zealand)</p>
<p>67 Rob Whitlock, Shane Tait</p>
<p>68 Geoff Ogilvy, Terry Price, Brad Lamb</p>
<p>69 Leith Wastle, Jean Van De Velde (France), Stephen Collins,</p>
<p>Michael Long (New Zealand), Richard Lee (New Zealand), Gavin</p>
<p>Coles, Euan Walters</p>
<p>70 Andrew Getson, Darren Barnes, Peter Lonard, Steve Alker (New</p>
<p>Zealand), Daniel Gaunt, Paul Moloney</p>
<p>Other scores</p>
<p>71 Robert Allenby</p>
<p>72 Stuart Appleby</p>
<p>73 Jens Nilsson (Sweden)</p>
<p>77 Ian Baker-Finch</p>
</text>
